---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import StravaFeed from '../components/StravaFeed.astro';
---
<Layout
  title="About"
  description="About Oskar Lindvall — Associate Director Development Quality at AstraZeneca, endurance runner and swimrunner, and father based in Gothenburg, Sweden."
>
  <h1>About</h1>

  <div class="profile">
    <img class="photo" src="/images/about/oskar-portrait.jpg" alt="Oskar Lindvall" width="160" height="160" />
    <div class="profile-links">
      <a class="pill" href="/about/cv">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8l-6-6z" /><path d="M14 2v6h6" /><line x1="8" y1="13" x2="16" y2="13" /><line x1="8" y1="17" x2="16" y2="17" /></svg>
        Professional CV
      </a>
      <a class="pill" href="/about/athletics">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="8" r="6" /><path d="M8.5 13.5 7 22l5-3 5 3-1.5-8.5" /></svg>
        Athletic results
      </a>
      <a class="pill" href="/projects/training-program">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="4" width="18" height="18" rx="2" /><line x1="3" y1="10" x2="21" y2="10" /><line x1="8" y1="2" x2="8" y2="6" /><line x1="16" y1="2" x2="16" y2="6" /></svg>
        Current training program
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <section>
    <h2>Professional bio</h2>
    <p>Have been working as a Line Manager for the past 4 years. Currently leading a UK/SE based team leading quality systems and digital initiatives within CMC Development (discovery science through Phase III) at AstraZeneca. My background spans consulting, global line management (SE/US/UK), PMO leadership, software development, and quality management in regulated environments — with a consistent thread of translating between technical, commercial, and regulatory worlds. I studied Management and Economics of Innovation and Mechanical Engineering at Chalmers. More on how I lead in practice is in my <a href="/reflections/chatbot-ecosystem">reflection on AI adoption</a> and on the <a href="/thoughts#leadership">Thoughts</a> page.</p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Personal bio</h2>
    <p>Outside of work, I balance training, family life with young kids, and career. I live with my wife Hanna and our two daughters Elvina (born 2022) and Malva (born 2026).</p>
    <p>I enjoy exercising — mostly running and swimruns. I train to stay healthy, to clear my mind, and to compete and challenge myself. Hanna and I are part of the same track-and-field club Majornas IK, and we prioritise training for both of us despite busy days. We feel better and manage stress and high workload much better as a result of it. Most importantly, exercise and movement should be fun and a natural part of life. Kids will do what you do — not what you say — so we try to lead by example. More on training and family is on the <a href="/thoughts#exercise">Thoughts</a> page.</p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Links</h2>
    <ul class="links">
      <li><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/oskar-lindvall-35735854/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">LinkedIn</a></li>
      <li><a href="https://www.strava.com/athletes/46830295" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Strava</a></li>
      <li><a href="https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/127870918-oskar-lindvall" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Goodreads</a></li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Strava activity</h2>
    <StravaFeed />
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  section {
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
  }

  .profile {
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }

  .photo {
    width: 160px;
    height: 160px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    object-fit: cover;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .profile-links {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }

  .pill {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    padding: 0.6rem 1.1rem;
    background: var(--color-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: 999px;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-card);
    color: var(--color-text);
    text-decoration: none;
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }

  .pill:hover {
    color: var(--color-accent);
    border-color: var(--color-accent);
  }

  .links {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }
</style>
